        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: குறிப்பிடு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறிப்பிடு — kuṟippiṭu — \"to mention; to specify\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவர் தன் கடிதத்தில் இந்தப் பிரச்சினையைக் குறிப்பிட்டார். avar taṉ kaṭitattil intap piracciṉaiyaik kuṟippiṭṭār. He mentioned this problem in his letter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): குறிப்பிட்டேன், kuṟippiṭṭēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is mentioned takes -ஐ. குறிப்பிட்ட, specific: குறிப்பிட்ட நேரம், a set time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "குறிப்பிடு (kuṟippiṭu) is native: kuṟippu, \"a mark, a sign\", belongs to kuṟi, \"to aim at, to mark\" (DEDR 1847), and iṭu, \"to put\" (DEDR 442), makes the verb: \"to put a mark on\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
